ll, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/082021ec/uploads/origins/f615c456-365f-4b29-91f1-1b7f0c0aa536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=73529a2eb0327fd5b8b3fee1fa35dc64", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/082021ec/uploads/origins/f615c456-365f-4b29-91f1-1b7f0c0aa536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=73529a2eb0327fd5b8b3fee1fa35dc64, https://si.imgix.net/082021ec/uploads/origins/f615c456-365f-4b29-91f1-1b7f0c0aa536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dbebdc5e8a3733caf27f060d049eb281 2x, https://si.imgix.net/082021ec/uploads/origins/f615c456-365f-4b29-91f1-1b7f0c0aa536?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7a33c8664533ee7cc944b9eed89f76e2 3x"}, "body": "曽田先生、こんにちは。前回のイラストがとても気に入ったので、ぜひまたお願いしたいです！今回は「ワイルズ」のメイプルのイラストをお願いします。\n\n用途はSNS投稿用とTwitterのバナー・アバターです。背景も入れていただけるとありがたいです。\n\n背景：舞台は「Wilds」のテントの中でお願いします！他に良い案があれば、そちらでも構いません。\n\n服装：ファイナルファンタジーXIVコラボのオメガFを着たメイプルを描いてくれると嬉しいです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OClnLDloqnM9SwjFLpwcIJryu0Aq0Q6o?usp=sharing\n\n具体的なキャラクター詳細\n\n目の下の赤いハイライトもお願いします！\n\nポーズと表情妖艶さと遊び心が混ざったような、どこか思わせぶりなシーンを希望します。詳細はお任せします。これまでの作品から、いくつか候補を挙げてください：\n\nhttps://x.com/Haruma_Soda/status/1761215022448136407/photo/1\n\nhttps://x.com/Haruma_Soda/status/1820833077607972952/photo/1\n\nもしご面倒でなければ、ケモノミミのバリエーションもお願いできますか？この部分は読み飛ばしていただいて結構ですが、そうしていただけると大変ありがたいです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17F1WHyx48XIckYPS9NxTsaJwoty2z7gD?usp=sharing\n\n(腰の緑猫のペンダントは外してください。）\n\nこの度はこのような依頼をお考えいただき、誠にありがとうございました。お返事お待ちしております。\n\n参考までに、彼女のオリジナルデザインを以下に添付します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1h6FYoXw7mq0ggFQG0sifRPg1wdx9ZsOT", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Haruma_Soda/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3147417, "client_id": 3044999, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7848ef653f46fab499db76e0a6b5bcf4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7848ef653f46fab499db76e0a6b5bcf4, https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1eaf9452fc30753049bc65504617f01a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a81d72c911101fac8b12723fc4ed976 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a2ea4e794b6301bed6069ff92fcf991f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a2ea4e794b6301bed6069ff92fcf991f, https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cecf25746cc8ca4cc55fa92697adac64 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e60e5d67/uploads/origins/fa66f64e-17ef-4b87-929e-017dd52b12d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=522dd45087d3073b321dcd98a2e9ac55 3x"}, "body": "Your Monster Hunter art is incredible! I request art of the vtuber Daisy Dandelion. She is a optimistic and cheerful lion girl with a flower theme. She is a huge gamer and fan of Monster Hunter. Her favorite monster is Lagombi. \n\nPlease draw Daisy riding on the Lagombi's shoulders. The requested pose is Lagombi standing on two legs roaring with his arms up. Lagombi does not have to lean to the side like he does in his provided pose reference. Please have Daisy mimic Lagombi's raised arms. Please draw Daisy using Lagombi female armor. Give Daisy a happy expression as she roars. Any winter background is ok to use. Not required, but an additional version of the same drawing where Daisy is holding a Lagombi switch axe over her head would be appreciated. References for everything are included. Transparent versions are also appreciated. Thank you for you consideration\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cJszSeDvCjgtJJ3OhZv3_G3WoeeDHMMV?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Haruma_Soda/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3147417, "client_id": 1458877, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f2282b75/uploads/origins/55849cd4-0d5e-4b14-9878-37938e8666e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e551d723a8ce0db02e9b6665ac8c0d87", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f2282b75/uploads/origins/55849cd4-0d5e-4b14-9878-37938e8666e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e551d723a8ce0db02e9b6665ac8c0d87, https://si.imgix.net/f2282b75/uploads/origins/55849cd4-0d5e-4b14-9878-37938e8666e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1ffbd297232b2c027818a65895e2755 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f2282b75/uploads/origins/55849cd4-0d5e-4b14-9878-37938e8666e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7072402025e8ce415bedac44ab5e1ee8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnai